Z||000000||MCordray||08-27-99||11:59 PM||||I've got an '86 GT and I've been stumped by the source of a brake noise. Whenever I hit the brakes, either still or moving, I hear a creeking noise from the front brakes that varies depending on the amount of pressure I put on the pedal. I've lubed the front calipers, but it didn't help. A friend of mine has an '88 GT with the same problem. Any suggestions???
Z||000001||Patrick||08-28-99||01:52 PM||||<br>I have the same problem with my '87, except the creaking sound doesn't seem to vary. It's the same consistent sound every time I apply the brakes. <p>I also have one heck of a rattle coming from the front somewhere. I've never been able to determine where it's coming from. It's probably not related to the creaking, but hey, just in case....<p><p><p>
Z||000002||MCordray||08-28-99||02:43 PM||||Patrick, Are we driving the same car? I've also got a rattle comming from the front end, it's very apparent when I go over a rough road. My rattle stops though when going over a rough road while applying the brakes. I've heard that the rattle may be due to a worn out steering stablizer. Does anyone know if the two noises are related?
Z||000003||theogre||08-28-99||08:06 PM||||are the anti rattle clips on the brake pads? are they any good? If not then the pads can rattle......<p>When you took off the calipers to lube them, did you clean out the area the ends of the pads sit in? the pads could be binding.<p>Yes, the stabiltizer could cause a rattle. also check the jack and spare are secure. check the radiator brackets as well. (I'm assuming you already checked the sway bar from end to end and the A arm bushings.
Z||000004||Patrick||08-29-99||01:25 PM||||<br>I can't speak for MCordray, but I guess there's a couple of things that Ogre mentioned that I should double check.<p>The only items I know that definitely are NOT causing the rattle are the spare and the jack. How can I be so sure? Simple, I don't keep 'em in the car. I know, I know, that's stupid. But hey, I like living on the edge...<IMG SRC="/ubb/smile.gif" WIDTH=15 HEIGHT=15><p> 
Z||000005||MCordray||08-29-99||08:19 PM||||Thanks for the insight theogre. I've got some front end inspection to do. Thanks again. 
