Z||000016||Patrick||09-02-99||05:29 PM||||<br>Yeah, I have to agree with Ozzy. The sound I hear is definitely more of a squawk than a squeal, if that makes any sense.<p>It's too bad we can't link to <b>wav files</b> here, or can we?<p>Cliff?<p>That way we could find a sound on the 'net or on a CD that sounds similar, or even record the actual sound from our cars, and then have it play back here.<p><p> 
